#: plugins/video/v4l/kdetv_v4l.desktop:41
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "This enables you to view video streams from a Video4Linux device."
msgstr "វា​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​មើលស្ទ្រីម​វីដេអូ​ពី​ឧបករណ៍ Video4Linux ។"

#: plugins/video/v4l2/kdetv_v4l2.desktop:9
